  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 301.30 Sanitary protective area",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 301.30 “Sanitary protective area” means an area in the immediate vicinity of a source within which activities are controlled to minimize the risk of groundwater contamination.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Dw 301) #11060, eff 4-1-16",
